WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.579
"The water feels nice!" Dipper said.

2
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:15.387
"You should come out," Jeb said.

3
00:00:15.388 --> 00:00:18.528
"Yeah," Eddy said.

4
00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:21.598
"Ms. Fender will be mad."

5
00:00:21.599 --> 00:00:25.040
But Dipper didn't listen.

6
00:00:25.041 --> 00:00:29.059
She went in even deeper.

7
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:36.699
Poppy went closer to the water.

8
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.666
The others followed.

9
00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:43.047
Brumm, brumm!

10
00:00:43.048 --> 00:00:46.559
Gasser splashed into the water.

11
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:55.484
Everyone laughed.

12
00:00:55.485 --> 00:00:59.821
Jeb scooped some water.

13
00:00:59.822 --> 00:01:07.636
Eddy dipped his tire.

14
00:01:07.637 --> 00:01:11.171
"I'm going in," Zippy said.

15
00:01:11.172 --> 00:01:14.066
He drove into the waves.

16
00:01:14.067 --> 00:01:16.976
"Me too!" Jeb said.

17
00:01:16.977 --> 00:01:21.811
He splashed into the water.

18
00:01:21.812 --> 00:01:26.040
Poppy went in next.

19
00:01:26.041 --> 00:01:33.565
"Come on, Eddy!" she said.

20
00:01:33.566 --> 00:01:39.190
Eddy went in.

21
00:01:39.191 --> 00:01:42.459
"This is fun!" he said.

22
00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:55.512
Everyone splashed and played.

23
00:01:55.513 --> 00:01:59.565
Pop!

24
00:01:59.566 --> 00:02:02.042
"Uh-oh!" Eddy said.

25
00:02:02.043 --> 00:02:04.807
"My engine stopped!"

